","entry_revision_identity":"e1a918c8d97b740a727e2c9beaeb2fec6206aec1214199bb97befe77a23826f8","logical_entry_identity":"73bea24d5e62de697a940af68ea2ca199cc6ea86fa5fc4f0aa966a74667619ca","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# re-appears.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target# 重新出现了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15c719d3fe7108895753bae142ea565f6963e9dc793c568d0314931c4cb8ca08","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e1a963d7fd3ac3ff91e77765d21d59c4c04a9e8532205b72828914ddb676ea86","logical_entry_identity":"07a91c207c5ae36590d1702413add3cb6e745bd13c95bab8fe30cc573d83787b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"+Larvae Infestation","source_tag":"_t","target":"+里奇幼虫寄生"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"383408d064a67f8c481d7a98ac8645e2e2b6d1ed3fe93a0366de6babb522d652","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e1b9e29afc135ebf02d12730ea646e0813297c8d8c3d57159fd2f4512fc39c3c","logical_entry_identity":"647b097294e61e63d5f07c02a87217b5868a848aec5293e3a509cd6a7ef9d82b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"On falling below 0 life, you engage an automated repair mode. While in this mode you cannot act, but can survive below -%d life, heal for %0.1f life each turn and have all resistances increased by %d%%. This will last until you are destroyed or until you are fully healed.\n\t\tThis effect has a cooldown.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当生命值降低到 0 点以下的时候，你会启动自动修理模式。在自动修理模式下，你不能活动，生命值下限为 -%d，每回合恢复 %0.1f 生命值，并且所有抗性增加 %d%%。这一效果直到你的生命值完全恢复或者你被摧毁才会终止。\n\t\t这一效果具有冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"53bc83c26140f74fc671fa6d0a532a5d07cf6f4bd22530e6c81054ff3fe40a67","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e1ca8329f18260b2a28bf8d1fcead8a84ab30af8e7e924c2eda22e65c4a3942e","logical_entry_identity":"a44fb82f2905029bc7281333cb20c5525f78f3c43db028779cc19a861de0f1c7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This belt utilizes an enchanted gem to focus a burst of steam into a powerful barrier.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这条腰带利用一颗附魔宝石，将喷涌的蒸汽聚集为一道强力屏障。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7df666cbf68427b6b747d7c27c0b37e15e415e735c8d5b79efbed962ca2787ea","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e1defe78f4daf4332350fdfeb2ddc92d448f2a624b14834c4527f493c2cc1768","logical_entry_identity":"0dae2695dd6cd4fc77289627a6caa1e14a97ca1b2405e5e6b8525e21b67b299f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You line your armor with explosive plating that detonates when struck. On taking a melee or ranged hit that deals more than 8%% of your maximum life a plate detonates, reducing the damage taken by %d%% and triggering a basic grenade attack in a radius %d cone projected at the target dealing %d%% of its usual damage.\n\t\tThis cannot trigger more than once per turn.\n\t\tBlocking an attack with your shield will also trigger the retaliation damage, if it has not already triggered this turn.\n\t\tYou have up to 3 plates at a time, and regain one every %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你在你的护甲上嵌入爆炸物装甲层，在被攻击的时候会发生爆炸。在近战或远程攻击对你造成超过最大生命值 8%% 的伤害的时候，装甲层会发生爆炸，降低所受到的伤害 %d%% 并在目标方向 %d 码范围的扇形区域内触发一次手榴弹攻击，造成平常的手榴弹 %d%% 的伤害。\n\t\t每回合最多触发一次该效果。\n\t\t如果该回合内没有触发过这一效果，使用盾牌格挡攻击也可以触发这样的反击伤害。\n\t\t你最多同时能有 3 层护甲层，每 %d 回合会补充一层。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"378741795628b9288313751b144dc5e877517e38713ba792b31a5a2c49e0d83d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e20ff184ac91e748bed64940a0f68c95143b294c4c7588b578753594deb5ad24","logical_entry_identity":"b6f0de1feecfc06e4273e7670daba1479872324e973c6a31c3df290131d70a47","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Evasive Shots","source_tag":"talent name","target":"闪避射击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5b8dfbb32de08d773d938da46c1cc05bc2bcb38beaa67f7712106f4b99200e3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e22110982939b298129de8390fb62b3ad1587cf0ea1092bbce3b61642783f6c9","logical_entry_identity":"9ef2509e2060b661f43063e54b2fdb21e05d64f76e9d01f3a18c82909e6ec3cf","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Gates of Morning","source_tag":"_t","target